# The sources are written with newline endings, and two tests read the sources
# themselves: the parameter end check in src/tpm/commands/parameter_check.rs and
# the key generation check in src/tpm/fips.rs. A checkout that converted them
# would leave those tests reading text that does not match what was written, so
# the ending is fixed here rather than left to a per-machine setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
